As we know, (a³ – b³) = (a – b) (a² + b² + ab)

Rightarrow frac{{192 times 192 times 192 - 8 times 8 times 8}}{{192 times 192 + 192 times 8 + 8 times 8}}

Rightarrow frac{{{{192}³} - {8³}}}{{{{192}²} + 192 times 8 + {8²}}}

Rightarrow frac{{( {192 - 8} )({{192}²} + 192 times 8 + {8²})}}{{{{192}²} + 192 times 8 + {8²}}}

⇒ (192 – 8)

⇒ 184

As we know, (a³ + b³) = (a + b) (a² + b² – ab)

Rightarrow frac{{132 times 132 times 132 + 68 times 68 times 68}}{{132 times 132 - 132 times 68 + 68 times 68}}

Rightarrow frac{{{{132}³} + {{68}³}}}{{{{132}²} - 132 times 68 + {{68}²}}}

Rightarrow frac{{( {132 + 68} )({{132}²} - 132 times 68 + {{68}²})}}{{{{192}²} - 132 times 8 + {8²}}}

⇒ (132 + 68)

⇒ 200
